# Adyen SDK-download key — copy this file to `adyen-sdk.properties` (gitignored) and fill it in.
#
# Request the key from Straumur — you do not need an Adyen account of your own. The config plugin
# reads this at `expo prebuild` and injects it as the `adyenSdkApiKey` Gradle property, which
# authenticates the download of the Adyen POS Mobile SDK from Adyen's credentialed maven repo.
#
# Never commit the real key. `adyen-sdk.properties` is gitignored; this `.example` is not.
adyenSdkApiKey=
